&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of leading cross-functional initiatives, managing dependencies and driving execution without relying on formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using data, spreadsheets, dashboards and CRM reports (plus basic SQL) to investigate performance trends and inform decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or improving sales processes, playbooks and KPIs, with a good understanding of CRM systems and sales tooling, as well as strong change management and adoption skills&lt;/li&gt;
