&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join a high-performing team laser-focused on taking over the market, building a world-class company, and solving the complex international expansion needs of thousands of employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this full-cycle outbound role, you will lead the charge in driving new logo acquisition across the EMEA region. We are looking for relentless hunters who excel at multi-threaded deal execution, master modern prospecting frameworks, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to maximize their impact. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a deep desire to win, this is your opportunity to build a high-growth sales career at the recognized leader in Employer of Record (EoR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Targeted Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute a sophisticated multi-channel prospecting motion (phone, email, social selling, video, etc.) to build a robust, high-quality pipeline across target EMEA accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Threaded Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strategic relationships across prospect organizations—from key operational champions up to economic buyers and C-level executives—aligning our solutions with their top-level business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the G-P Value Proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a domain expert on global hiring, articulating the strategic, financial, and operational benefits of G-P as the premier global Employer of Record (EoR) provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex sales cycles from initial cold outreach to discovery, solution mapping, commercial proposal generation, objection handling, and deal closure against monthly targets.&lt;/li&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer Product Intelligence (Materials Engineering – Chemistry &amp;amp; Thin Film Design) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek a Senior AI/ML Engineer to develop practical, science-grounded ML solutions for materials science and semiconductor applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and support AI models and workflows for relevant chemical systems for thin film development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model &amp;amp; embedded known physics &amp;amp; mechanisms to ensure accurate model output and turnaround time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of SoTA GenAI frameworks for materials science and ML tools deliver applications that acceleration R&amp;amp;D workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build data pipelines to extract required data from multi-modal data sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with software &amp;amp; data science engineers to deliver reproducible pipelines, dashboards, APIs and decision-support tools for R&amp;amp;D and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers define modelling standards and communicate across AI/ML, chemistry, materials and semiconductor teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD or MSc with strong expertise in CS, Data Science, Materials Science, Physics, Chemistry, Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building ML models, tools and frameworks for materials science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years’ experience in applying AI/ML or computational methods (MLIPs, DFT, MD, kMC, etc.) to complex scientific or engineering problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience on atomistic to feature scale AI tools &amp;amp; frameworks – generative models, deterministic models, Stochastic models, active learning/reinforcement learning Python, PyTorch/TensorFlow/JAX/scikit-learn&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate physical, chemical and engineering challenges into practical AI/ML workflows for materials engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML experience in semiconductor materials engineering or in relevant chemistry/materials system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will thrive in this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate bridges advanced AI/ML engineering, materials engineering/process R&amp;amp;D, and eager to solve problems that make an impact to the users&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blan

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
