&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt;! Geotab is seeking a Senior Product Manager who will oversee product development from conception to launch across multiple products or segments and discover, develop, and cultivate new products and ongoing product enhancements that support Geotab’s business models and continued growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4&quot;&gt;. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,6&quot;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,0&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Manager your key area of

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team rewriting the rules in private markets.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moonfare delivers what few others can: the highly sought-after funds and hidden-gem investments that go beyond what most private banks offer. Every opportunity is subjected to a ruthless vetting process; the bar is unforgivingly high. The result? Institutional-quality portfolios for investors who demand more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines finance veterans with talent from tech, consulting, law and industries you’d never expect. Headquartered in Berlin, we operate from eight offices across Europe, the US and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build what&#39;s next in private markets, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moonfare, we are leading a new era of private equity investing. We are seeking an exceptional Chief of Staff to join our executive team at a pivotal moment in our growth. Reporting directly to the co-CEO, this highly strategic role sits at the intersection of strategy, business management, and leadership, driving Moonfare’s most critical initiatives, from embedding AI across the business to guiding our transformation into a premier Asset Manager. This is a hands-on role: you’ll move from advising on strategy to delivering it yourself, rolling up your sleeves to make things happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate high-priority, company-wide initiatives from conception to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and orchestrate the bi-weekly ExCo run and change meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and project manage strategic priorities including Moonfare’s evolution into an Asset Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to the co-CEOs and ExCo, applying first-principles thinking and analytical rigor to structure complex challenges and deliver actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and manage the executive operating rhythm: leadership offsites, board preparation, and critical business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support board, investor, and partner engagements, ensuring clear, compelling communication of Moonfare’s strategy and progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a connector across departments and geographies, enabling alignment and seamless execution of Moonfare’s vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next Moonfarian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3–4 years of significant experience in a top-tier management consulting firm or senior strategic leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading large-scale, cross-functional initiatives in dynamic, complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills, combining first-principles thinking with a highly analytical, data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and stakeholder management capabilities, with the gravitas to influence at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in financial services, asset management, or FinTech is advantageous but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you feel you do not meet all of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Impact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You are empowered to bring ideas, make decisions, and see your work directly contribute to Moonfare&#39;s success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Environment:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We believe in open communication. You will receive regular updates on company strategy, performance against our KPIs, and key business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We support your development with an individual growth budget of €1,500 or 2% of your base salary (whichever is higher).&lt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As a Fullstack Staff Engineer on the Actions team, you&#39;ll take on one of our most important platform challenges: defining how extensibility works across Staffbase. Today, extensions power everything from HR integrations to the actions our AI assistant, Navigator, performs on a user&#39;s behalf — but there&#39;s no single, easy way to build and extend. That&#39;s what you&#39;ll design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Your north star is a framework that our engineers, our Labs team, and eventually customers themselves can use to build their own extensions, whether that&#39;s a one-off integration for a single customer or a tier-one capability used across our entire base. You&#39;ll build the core, define the standards, and make the calls on where we standardise versus where we stay flexible, all on a mature, multi-tenant platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who wants to drive, not just deliver, shaping the direction of a genuinely open-ended problem and setting the technical foundations others will build on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As part of our tech stack, we are using: React.js, JavaScript, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Kotlin, Go, Java, MongoDB, Terraform, Docker and Playwright, to name a few.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
