&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide functional leadership and daily operational guidance to the team within the technical data function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute hands-on contribution to projects through data migration and data transformation using Python-based ETL tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the team’s work allocation and coordinate activities to ensure results are driven by the team in collaboration with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the team in issue resolution and escalate blockers proactively, maintaining alignment with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support career development by providing continuous feedback loops on technical and project execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive opportunities to improve tools, workflows, and automation for greater efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
